  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">📖 <strong>القرآن الكريم | سورة المرسلات (Surah Al-Mursalat)</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>رقم السورة: 77 | عدد الآيات: 50 | مكية | تقع في الصفحة رقم: 582</strong><br><strong>الترجمة الإنجليزية: Al-Mursalat</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🌸 <em>الحمد لله الذي أنزل على عبده الكتاب ولم يجعل له عوجًا، والصلاة والسلام على من أرسله الله رحمة للعالمين</em> 🌸</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">نسأل الله العليّ القدير أن يجعل هذا العمل خالصًا لوجهه الكريم، وأن يوفقنا لخدمة كتابه العزيز، وأن يجعله نورًا لنا في الدنيا والآخرة.<br>سورة المرسلات من السور المكية، تناولت بأسلوب قوي مشاهد يوم القيامة، </p>\n\n\n\n</script>\n<div class=\"card mt-3\">\n<h3 style = \"font-size: 21px;\" class=\"mt-20 mb-20\"><a id=\"mp3\" name=\"3\">الاستماع لسورة المرسلات</a></h3>\n<form class=\"form\" role=\"form\"><select class=\"form-control\" id=\"reciter_ayates\" style=\"width:60%;\" onchange=\"updateplayer()\"><option value=\"https://archive.org/download/Ammar-Almulla/077.mp3\">عمار الملا علي</option><option value=\"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/ahmed_ibn_3ali_al-3ajamy/077.mp3\">احمد إبن علي العجمي</option><option value=\"https://ia803208.us.archive.org/21/items/hassan_mohaed_saleh/077.mp3\">حسن صالح</option><option value=\"https://server10.mp3quran.net/jleel/077.mp3\">خالد الجليل</option><option value=\"https://server7.mp3quran.net/shur/077.mp3\">سعود الشريم </option><option value=\"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/077.mp3\">ابو بكر الشاطري </option><option value=\"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdulbaset_mujawwad/077.mp3\">عبد الباسط مجود</option><option value=\"https://server11.mp3quran.net/sds/077.mp3\">عبد الرحمن السديس</option><option value=\"https://server6.mp3quran.net/bsfr/077.mp3\">عبد الله بصفر</option><option value=\"https://server13.mp3quran.net/jhn/077.mp3\">عبد الله الجهني</option><option value=\"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/huthayfi/077.mp3\">علي الحذيفي</option><option value=\"https://server9.mp3quran.net/omar_warsh/077.mp3\">عمر القزابري ورش</option><option value=\"https://server8.mp3quran.net/frs_a/077.mp3\">فارس عباد</option><option value=\"https://server12.mp3quran.net/maher/077.mp3\">ماهر المعيقلي</option><option value=\"https://server10.mp3quran.net/minsh/077.mp3\">محمد صديق المنشاوي</option><option value=\"https://server13.mp3quran.net/husr/077.mp3\">محمود خليل الحصري</option><option value=\"https://ia801002.us.archive.org/14/items/golmami2005_yahoo_002_20180409_1406/077.mp3\">مصطفى اسماعيل</option><option value=\"https://ia803201.us.archive.org/8/items/noreen-sedeeq/077.mp3\">نورين محمد صديق</option><option value=\"https://server8.mp3quran.net/afs/077.mp3\">مشاري العفاسي</option><option value=\"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/complete/077.mp3\">سعد الغامدي</option><option value=\"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/077.mp3\">ياسر الدوسري</option></select></form>\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n<audio id=\"player\" controls=\"controls\">\n  <source id=\"mp3ppl\" src=\"https://archive.org/download/Ammar-Almulla/077.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\nYour browser does not support the audio element.\n</audio>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n     <br />\n\n<script>\n  function updateplayer() {\n    // 1. الحصول على رابط القارئ المختار\n    var newSourceUrl = document.getElementById('reciter_ayates').value;\n\n    // 2. الحصول على عنصر المصدر داخل المشغل (الذي يحمل الـ ID = mp3ppl)\n    var sourceElement = document.getElementById('mp3ppl');\n\n    // 3. تحديث خاصية src لهذا العنصر بالرابط الجديد\n    sourceElement.src = newSourceUrl;\n\n    // 4. الحصول على عنصر المشغل نفسه (الذي يحمل الـ ID = player)\n    var player = document.getElementById('player');\n\n    // 5. أمر المشغل بإعادة تحميل الملف الصوتي الجديد\n    player.load();\n\n    // 6. (اختياري) يمكنك إلغاء التعليق عن السطر التالي ليبدأ التشغيل تلقائياً\n    // player.play();\n  }\n</script>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"background-color: #EAEAEA; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0;\">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><script type=\"text/javascript\">\n  function changesoundy(ID) {\n    var sound_id = document.getElementById(\"quran_player_by_sora\");\n    sound_id.innerHTML = '<div style=\"margin-top:15px;\"><audio controls autoplay><source src=\"'+ID+'\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">Your browser does not support the audio element.</audio><br /><a href=\"'+ID+'\">Download this file</a></div>';\n  }\n</script><h2 class=\"sora_title\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) - المرسلات</h2><div id=\"quran_player_by_sora\"></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077001.mp3');\">وَالْمُرْسَلَاتِ عُرْفًا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [1]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077001.mp3');\">By those [winds] sent forth in gusts <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [1]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077002.mp3');\">فَالْعَاصِفَاتِ عَصْفًا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [2]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077002.mp3');\">And the winds that blow violently <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [2]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077003.mp3');\">وَالنَّاشِرَاتِ نَشْرًا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [3]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077003.mp3');\">And [by] the winds that spread [clouds] <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [3]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077004.mp3');\">فَالْفَارِقَاتِ فَرْقًا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [4]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077004.mp3');\">And those [angels] who bring criterion <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [4]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077005.mp3');\">فَالْمُلْقِيَاتِ ذِكْرًا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [5]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077005.mp3');\">And those [angels] who deliver a message <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [5]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077006.mp3');\">عُذْرًا أَوْ نُذْرًا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [6]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077006.mp3');\">As justification or warning, <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [6]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077007.mp3');\">إِنَّمَا تُوعَدُونَ لَوَاقِعٌ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [7]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077007.mp3');\">Indeed, what you are promised is to occur. <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [7]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077008.mp3');\">فَإِذَا النُّجُومُ طُمِسَتْ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [8]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077008.mp3');\">So when the stars are obliterated <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [8]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077009.mp3');\">وَإِذَا السَّمَاءُ فُرِجَتْ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [9]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077009.mp3');\">And when the heaven is opened <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [9]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077010.mp3');\">وَإِذَا الْجِبَالُ نُسِفَتْ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [10]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077010.mp3');\">And when the mountains are blown away <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [10]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077011.mp3');\">وَإِذَا الرُّسُلُ أُقِّتَتْ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [11]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077011.mp3');\">And when the messengers' time has come... <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [11]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077012.mp3');\">لِأَيِّ يَوْمٍ أُجِّلَتْ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [12]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077012.mp3');\">For what Day was it postponed? <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [12]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077013.mp3');\">لِيَوْ