national_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077016.mp3');\">Did We not destroy the former peoples? <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [16]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077017.mp3');\">ثُمَّ نُتْبِعُهُمُ الْآخِرِينَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [17]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077017.mp3');\">Then We will follow them with the later ones. <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [17]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077018.mp3');\">كَذَٰلِكَ نَفْعَلُ بِالْمُجْرِمِينَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [18]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077018.mp3');\">Thus do We deal with the criminals. <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [18]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/077019.mp3');\">وَيْلٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">المرسلات [19]</span></div><div class=\"aya_en_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('http://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/English_Translated_by_Sahih_International_Recited_by_Ibrahim_Walk/077019.mp3');\">Woe, that Day, to the deniers. <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">Al-Mursalat ( Those sent forth ) [19]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><di